00:11:45.280 --> 00:11:46.400
Well, that's so sweet.

297
00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:48.060
Well, I couldn't agree more with that.

298
00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:48.380
I know.

299
00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:48.940
I know.

