00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:51.460
His energy is just fantastic.

301
00:11:51.780 --> 00:11:53.960
So smart, so funny, and so kind.

302
00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:54.560
Yeah.

303
00:11:55.180 --> 00:11:59.620
Well, Jenna, later when we break down the episode, I have a little story I want to share about Lester

