660
00:24:35.150 --> 00:24:38.510
about how America was going to ruin the office.

661
00:24:40.050 --> 00:24:41.570
And there was a little picture

662
00:24:41.570 --> 00:24:43.310
of my face in a bubble

663
00:24:43.850 --> 00:24:45.430
comparing me to Lucy Davis.

664
00:24:46.230 --> 00:24:48.550
And there were bubbles of all our faces

665
00:24:49.190 --> 00:24:50.730
talking about how we,

666
00:24:52.510 --> 00:24:53.390
specifically outlining

667
00:24:53.390 --> 00:24:56.270
how we were each going to ruin the show.

668
00:24:56.990 --> 00:24:58.190
Yeah, I still have it.

669
00:24:58.210 --> 00:24:59.610
I put it in a scrapbook.

670
00:25:00.190 --> 00:25:01.510
Let me tell you right now, Jenna,

671
00:25:01.650 --> 00:25:02.490
what really happened was

672
00:25:02.490 --> 00:25:04.270
Ricky and I had that manufactured specially

673
00:25:04.970 --> 00:25:06.410
and placed on the tube.

674
00:25:07.110 --> 00:25:08.010
Planted on the tube

675
00:25:08.010 --> 00:25:09.910
in order to really make you

676
00:25:09.910 --> 00:25:10.810
buck up your ideas

677
00:25:10.810 --> 00:25:11.730
and do a good job.

678
00:25:13.970 --> 00:25:15.150
But it's funny you should say that

679
00:25:15.150 --> 00:25:16.750
because I remember

680
00:25:16.750 --> 00:25:20.470
that when it was first being discussed,

681
00:25:20.610 --> 00:25:21.150
as you say,

682
00:25:21.250 --> 00:25:22.070
there were a lot of things about,

683
00:25:22.310 --> 00:25:23.410
oh, America is going to ruin the show.

684
00:25:23.510 --> 00:25:24.110
And then there was,

685
00:25:25.010 --> 00:25:27.230
when your show started airing in the UK,

686
00:25:27.410 --> 00:25:27.850
it was kind of,

687
00:25:28.070 --> 00:25:29.990
oh, it's not as good as the British version.

688
00:25:30.110 --> 00:25:31.050
And then over time,

689
00:25:31.290 --> 00:25:32.090
it's become,

690
00:25:32.090 --> 00:25:33.670
the American version is far superior

691
00:25:33.670 --> 00:25:34.450
to the British version.

692
00:25:34.570 --> 00:25:35.190
This is the British,

693
00:25:35.490 --> 00:25:36.870
this is the way we do things here.

694
00:25:36.990 --> 00:25:37.210
You know what I mean?

695
00:25:37.210 --> 00:25:37.450
We're like,

696
00:25:37.570 --> 00:25:38.830
we kind of build you up

697
00:25:38.830 --> 00:25:39.850
and then we knock you down.

698
00:25:40.850 --> 00:25:41.750
And so yeah,

699
00:25:41.810 --> 00:25:42.490
now very much

700
00:25:42.490 --> 00:25:43.370
the American version

701
00:25:43.370 --> 00:25:45.210
is kind of the much-loved version,

702
00:25:45.390 --> 00:25:46.950
even by the British press.

703
00:25:47.370 --> 00:25:48.890
And Ricky and I are seen as kind of,

704
00:25:49.010 --> 00:25:49.650
oh, those guys.

705
00:25:49.910 --> 00:25:50.550
We're tired of those guys.

706
00:25:50.590 --> 00:25:51.510
No, no.

707
00:25:51.750 --> 00:25:52.530
It's amazing.

708
00:25:52.950 --> 00:25:53.670
It's amazing.

709
00:25:53.910 --> 00:25:54.950
Maybe it'll come full circle.

710
00:25:55.430 --> 00:25:57.150
Well, I remember meeting you guys

711
00:25:57.770 --> 00:25:59.470
on the new set

712
00:25:59.470 --> 00:26:00.270
when we moved,

713
00:26:00.330 --> 00:26:00.590
you know,

714
00:26:00.590 --> 00:26:01.690
way deep in the valley,

715
00:26:01.950 --> 00:26:02.910
Chandler Valley Studios.

716
00:26:03.470 --> 00:26:04.690
And I'll never forget

717
00:26:04.690 --> 00:26:06.330
