719
00:26:08.370 --> 00:26:09.410
And I think by now,

720
00:26:09.490 --> 00:26:10.130
the supporting cast,

721
00:26:10.310 --> 00:26:11.170
we were actually,

722
00:26:11.910 --> 00:26:13.430
