00:26:14.070 --> 00:26:15.730
So I think I was a little braver

724
00:26:15.730 --> 00:26:16.990
to like come up and say hi

725
00:26:16.990 --> 00:26:18.890
because maybe no one would fire me now

726
00:26:18.890 --> 00:26:20.330
