731
00:26:27.250 --> 00:26:27.510
Angela,

732
00:26:27.510 --> 00:26:28.970
you're the first talking head

733
00:26:28.970 --> 00:26:29.970
up after lunch

734
00:26:29.970 --> 00:26:32.550
and Ricky and Stephen will be here.

735
00:26:32.710 --> 00:26:33.230
And I just went,

736
00:26:33.370 --> 00:26:33.990
like,

737
00:26:33.990 --> 00:26:34.490
I was like,

738
00:26:34.570 --> 00:26:35.130
oh, no.

739
00:26:35.370 --> 00:26:35.770
No,

740
00:26:35.830 --> 00:26:37.470
I just got the courage to say hi.

741
00:26:37.810 --> 00:26:39.270
Please don't make me do a talking head

742
00:26:39.270 --> 00:26:39.850
in front of them.

743
00:26:40.130 --> 00:26:41.190
And Ricky said,

744
00:26:41.330 --> 00:26:42.110
oh, don't worry.

745
00:26:42.250 --> 00:26:43.890
I don't tsk too loudly.

746
00:26:44.170 --> 00:26:45.210
And he did his finger.

747
00:26:46.170 --> 00:26:47.110
And I was like,

748
00:26:47.410 --> 00:26:47.550
ah,

749
00:26:48.090 --> 00:26:50.230
and then sort of broke into a cold sweat.

750
00:26:50.230 --> 00:26:52.370
But it was-

751
00:26:52.370 --> 00:26:53.190
I hope though that we,

752
00:26:53.290 --> 00:26:53.950
I hope ultimately,

753
00:26:54.290 --> 00:26:54.630
you know,

754
00:26:54.750 --> 00:26:56.970
I think we always ultimately

755
00:26:56.970 --> 00:26:58.030
tried to be supportive

756
00:26:58.430 --> 00:26:59.110
when we could.

757
00:26:59.210 --> 00:26:59.950
We were kind of aware

758
00:26:59.950 --> 00:27:01.010
that it was like there was this,

759
00:27:01.290 --> 00:27:02.790
I think just because we had British accents

760
00:27:02.790 --> 00:27:04.210
and we'd come from a long way away,

761
00:27:04.210 --> 00:27:04.750
it was like,

762
00:27:04.770 --> 00:27:06.470
it was like the queen had come to visit.

763
00:27:06.590 --> 00:27:06.950
Yes!

764
00:27:07.150 --> 00:27:08.270
And we were aware of that.

765
00:27:08.410 --> 00:27:09.510
And I think trying to kind of,

766
00:27:09.710 --> 00:27:09.830
you know,

767
00:27:09.890 --> 00:27:10.630
make sure people realized

768
00:27:10.630 --> 00:27:12.830
we weren't here to judge or be mean.

769
00:27:13.130 --> 00:27:13.650
Oh, no,

770
00:27:13.730 --> 00:27:14.450
you guys were great.

771
00:27:14.570 --> 00:27:14.830
We were,

772
00:27:14.830 --> 00:27:16.090
we were just abuzz

773
00:27:16.090 --> 00:27:18.150
about having you guys on the set.

774
00:27:18.270 --> 00:27:19.210
And then when you came,

775
00:27:19.210 --> 00:27:19.750
I guess, you know,

776
00:27:19.870 --> 00:27:21.710
we're talking about customer survey this week.

777
00:27:22.010 --> 00:27:23.450
When you came to the set,

778
00:27:23.990 --> 00:27:25.670
I read that you were in the writer's room

779
00:27:25.670 --> 00:27:27.530
for weeks before we actually shot.

780
00:27:27.830 --> 00:27:28.970
Yes, yes, absolutely.

781
00:27:29.270 --> 00:27:29.630
Yeah,

782
00:27:29.770 --> 00:27:30.770
and we always ask people

783
00:27:30.770 --> 00:27:32.150
how they got their job on the office.

784
00:27:32.350 --> 00:27:33.450
I think we know

785
00:27:33.450 --> 00:27:35.150
you started by creating,

786
00:27:35.650 --> 00:27:37.410
but how did you end up directing

787
00:27:37.410 --> 00:27:38.730
this particular episode?

788
00:27:38.990 --> 00:27:39.530
Do you remember?

789
00:27:39.990 --> 00:27:40.750
Well, I think

790
00:27:41.610 --> 00:27:42.810
whenever I had visited,

791
00:27:42.970 --> 00:27:44.250
because I used to kind of visit

792
00:27:44.250 --> 00:27:45.510
whenever I was in LA,

793
00:27:45.650 --> 00:27:46.310
sometimes with Ricky

794
00:27:46.310 --> 00:27:46.950
and sometimes without.

795
00:27:47.150 --> 00:27:48.170
And I tried to come,

796
00:27:48.250 --> 00:27:48.810
you know,

797
00:27:49.210 --> 00:27:50.350
finish the season and stop by.

798
00:27:51.490 --> 00:27:52.550
And I was always very,

799
00:27:53.690 --> 00:27:55.750
I just loved being in the writer's room

800
00:27:56.970 --> 00:27:57.610
because in,

801
00:27:57.710 --> 00:27:58.590
you've got to remember in the UK,

802
00:27:58.810 --> 00:27:58.930
you know,

803
00:27:59.050 --> 00:28:01.290
Ricky and I wrote the show together

